  "title": "No-Bake Chocolate Oat Bars",
  "description": "These yummy no-bake oatmeal bars with a chocolaty peanut butter layer are quick to make — you just need patience to let them set up in the fridge!",
  "authors": [
    "Traci"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-02-27T20:22:27-05:00",
